<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Daniel Lambs Reigns — Websites That Get You Customers</title>
<meta name="description" content="Daniel Lambs Reigns — freelance web developer in Uganda. Professional, mobile-friendly business websites. Message on WhatsApp or call 0742 096022.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#0A1930;
    --ink-soft:#132A47;
    --paper:#F3F6FB;
    --paper-dim:#E6ECF6;
    --blue:#3E6AE1;
    --blue-deep:#2A4BB8;
    --blue-light:#A9C4FF;
    --whatsapp:#25D366;
    --line: rgba(10,25,48,0.12);
    --line-paper: rgba(243,246,251,0.18);
    --shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgba(10,25,48,0.35);
    --radius: 2px;
    --maxw: 1180px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Manrope', sans-serif;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    line-height:1.08;
  }

  .wrap{ max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 22px; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size:11.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.22em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue-deep);
  }
  .eyebrow.on-dark{ color:var(--blue-light); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation-duration:0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.01ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important; }
  }

  /* ===== Header ===== */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(243,246,251,0.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:14px 22px;
    max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:21px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  .logo span{ color:var(--blue-deep); font-style:italic; font-weight:400; }
  .nav-links{ display:none; gap:28px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }
  .nav-links a{ opacity:0.75; transition:opacity .2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover{ opacity:1; color:var(--blue-deep); }
  .nav-cta{ display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
    padding:11px 18px;
    font-size:13px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.02em;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--blue-deep); outline-offset:3px; }
  .btn-main{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }
  .btn-main:hover{ background:var(--blue-deep); transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost{ border-color:var(--ink); color:var(--ink); background:transparent; }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }
  .btn-whatsapp{ background:var(--whatsapp); color:#fff; }
  .btn-whatsapp:hover{ filter:brightness(1.06); transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-sm{ padding:9px 14px; font-size:12px; }
  .btn svg{ width:16px; height:16px; flex-shrink:0; }

  @media(min-width:860px){
    .nav-links{ display:flex; }
  }

  /* ===== Hero ===== */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    padding:64px 0 56px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 620px 420px at 78% 8%, rgba(62,106,225,0.35), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 500px 500px at 10% 100%, rgba(62,106,225,0.14), transparent 65%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .bulbs{
    display:flex; gap:9px; margin-bottom:26px; position:relative; z-index:1;
  }
  .bulb{
    width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--blue-light);
    box-shadow:0 0 10px 2px rgba(169,196,255,0.55);
    animation: glow 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .bulb:nth-child(2){ animation-delay:.25s; }
  .bulb:nth-child(3){ animation-delay:.5s; }
  .bulb:nth-child(4){ animation-delay:.75s; }
  .bulb:nth-child(5){ animation-delay:1s; }
  @keyframes glow{
    0%,100%{ opacity:0.35; }
    50%{ opacity:1; }
  }

  .hero-inner{ position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(38px, 8.5vw, 68px);
    max-width:16ch;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic; color:var(--blue-light); font-weight:400;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:16.5px;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:rgba(243,246,251,0.78);
    max-width:48ch;
  }
  .hero-actions{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;
    margin-top:32px;
  }
  .hero-meta{
    margin-top:44px;
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:28px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-paper);
    padding-top:22px;
  }
  .hero-meta div{ font-size:13px; color:rgba(243,246,251,0.65); }
  .hero-meta strong{
    display:block; font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:500; font-size:18px; color:var(--paper); margin-bottom:3px;
  }

  /* ===== Section shell ===== */
  section{ padding:76px 0; }
  .section-head{ max-width:640px; margin-bottom:44px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-size:clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px); margin-top:10px; }
  .section-head p{ margin-top:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.75; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; }

  .divider{
    width:100%; height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--blue), transparent);
    margin:0;
  }

  /* ===== How it works ===== */
  .how{ background:var(--paper); }
  .steps-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:14px; }
  @media(min-width:720px){ .steps-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); } }
  .step-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:#fff;
    padding:26px 22px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    transition:border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .step-card:hover{ border-color:var(--blue); box-shadow:var(--shadow); transform:translateY(-3px); }
  .step-card .step-num{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-style:italic; font-size:26px; color:var(--blue-deep); margin-bottom:14px; display:block;
  }
  .step-card h3{ font-size:17px; font-weight:500; }
  .step-card p{ margin-top:8px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.7; line-height:1.55; }

  /* ===== Services ===== */
  .services{ background:var(--paper-dim); }
  .svc-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:14px; }
  @media(min-width:720px){ .svc-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
  @media(min-width:1020px){ .svc-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); } }

  .svc-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:#fff;
    padding:26px 24px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    transition:border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
  }
  .svc-card:hover{ border-color:var(--blue); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .svc-card h3{ font-size:18px; font-weight:500; }
  .svc-card .svc-note{
    margin-top:8px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.65; line-height:1.55;
  }

  /* ===== Why ===== */
  .why{ background:var(--paper); }
  .why-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:12px; }
  @media(min-width:720px){ .why-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
  .why-item{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;
    padding:18px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); background:#fff;
  }
  .why-item .check{
    flex:none; width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(62,106,225,0.12); color:var(--blue-deep);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:13px; margin-top:2px;
  }
  .why-item p{ margin:0; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.85; line-height:1.55; }
  .why-item strong{ color:var(--ink); opacity:1; font-weight:700; }

  /* ===== Portfolio (dark, was gallery) ===== */
  .portfolio{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }
  .portfolio .section-head p{ color:rgba(243,246,251,0.65); }
  .port-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; }
  @media(min-width:720px){ .port-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
  .port-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line-paper);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    overflow:hidden;
    background:rgba(243,246,251,0.03);
  }
  .port-chrome{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:10px 14px;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-paper);
  }
  .port-chrome span{ width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(243,246,251,0.2); }
  .port-screen{ height:120px; padding:18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px; justify-content:center; }
  .port-screen .bar{ height:8px; border-radius:2px; background:rgba(243,246,251,0.12); }
  .port-body{ padding:20px 22px 24px; }
  .port-tag{
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--blue-light);
    background:rgba(62,106,225,0.16); display:inline-block; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .port-body h3{ font-size:17px; font-weight:500; }
  .port-body p{ margin-top:8px; font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(243,246,251,0.6); line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:16px; }

  /* ===== Pricing ===== */
  .pricing{ background:var(--paper-dim); }
  .pricing-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; }
  @media(min-width:800px){ .pricing-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); } }
  .plan{
    border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:30px 24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; position:relative;
  }
  .plan.featured{ border-color:var(--blue); box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--blue) inset; }
  .plan .badge{
    position:absolute; top:-12px; right:22px; background:var(--blue); color:#fff;
    font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:20px; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .plan h3{ font-size:19px; font-weight:500; }
  .plan .price-tag{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.6; letter-spacing:0.04em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .plan .desc{ font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.75; line-height:1.5; }
  .plan ul{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px; margin-top:4px; }
  .plan li{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.85; display:flex; gap:9px; }
  .plan li::before{ content:"—"; color:var(--blue-deep); flex:none; }
  .plan .btn{ margin-top:auto; }

  /* ===== About ===== */
  .about{ background:var(--paper); }
  .about-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px; align-items:center; }
  @media(min-width:900px){ .about-grid{ grid-template-columns:0.8fr 1.2fr; } }
  .about-photo-frame{
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); overflow:hidden;
    aspect-ratio:4/4.6; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .about-photo-frame img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .about-text p{ font-size:15.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.85; line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:14px; max-width:56ch; }
  .about-name-card{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-top:22px;
    padding:14px 16px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); background:#fff;
  }
  .about-name-card img{ width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:50%; object-fit:cover; flex:none; }
  .about-name-card .name{ font-weight:700; font-size:14px; }
  .about-name-card .role{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.65; }

  /* ===== Contact ===== */
  .contact{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }
  .contact .section-head p{ color:rgba(243,246,251,0.65); }
  .c-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:44px; }
  @media(min-width:900px){ .c-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }

  .contact-methods{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px; }
  .cm-item{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
    padding:16px; border:1px solid var(--line-paper); border-radius:var(--radius);
    transition:border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }
  .cm-item:hover{ border-color:var(--blue); background:rgba(62,106,225,0.06); }
  .cm-icon{
    width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(169,196,255,0.12);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .cm-icon svg{ width:18px; height:18px; color:var(--blue-light); }
  .cm-text small{ display:block; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(243,246,251,0.5); margin-bottom:3px; }
  .cm-text strong{ font-size:15px; font-weight:700; }

  form{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
  .field label{ display:block; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(243,246,251,0.55); margin-bottom:7px; }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea{
    width:100%; background:rgba(243,246,251,0.04);
    border:1px solid var(--line-paper);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:13px 14px; color:var(--paper); font-family:inherit; font-size:14.5px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus{ outline:none; border-color:var(--blue); }
  .field textarea{ min-height:100px; resize:vertical; }
  .field input::placeholder, .field textarea::placeholder{ color:rgba(243,246,251,0.3); }
  .field select option{ color:#111; }
  .form-note{ font-size:12px; color:rgba(243,246,251,0.45); line-height:1.5; }

  /* ===== Final CTA ===== */
  .final-cta{
    background:var(--paper-dim); text-align:center;
  }
  .final-cta h2{ font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px); }
  .final-cta p{ margin-top:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.75; font-size:15.5px; max-width:520px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }
  .final-actions{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; justify-content:center; margin-top:30px; }

  /* ===== Footer ===== */
  footer{
    background:var(--ink); color:rgba(243,246,251,0.5);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-paper);
    padding:30px 0;
    font-size:13px;
  }
  .foot-row{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; }
  @media(min-width:640px){ .foot-row{ flex-direction:row; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; } }

  /* ===== Floating WhatsApp ===== */
  .float-wa{
    position:fixed; bottom:20px; right:20px; z-index:60;
    width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--whatsapp); color:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:0 10px 26px -6px rgba(37,211,102,0.55);
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .float-wa:hover{ transform:scale(1.06); }
  .float-wa svg{ width:26px; height:26px; }

  .reveal{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(16px); transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
  .reveal.in{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">Daniel Lambs <span>Reigns</span></a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how">How It Works</a></li>
      <li><a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-sm" href="https://wa.me/256742096022?text=Hello%20Daniel%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20getting%20a%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20my%20requirements." target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.29-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.7 1.2h.01c5.46 0 9.9-4.45 9.9-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.02c-.24.68-1.4 1.32-1.93 1.4-.5.08-1.13.11-1.83-.11-.42-.13-.96-.31-1.66-.6-2.92-1.26-4.83-4.2-4.98-4.4-.15-.19-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.02 0-1.43.75-2.14 1.02-2.43.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.19 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.24.58.82 2.01.9 2.15.07.15.12.32.02.51-.1.19-.15.31-.29.48-.15.17-.31.38-.44.51-.15.15-.3.31-.13.6.17.29.76 1.25 1.63 2.03 1.12 1 2.06 1.31 2.35 1.46.29.15.46.13.63-.08.17-.2.72-.84.92-1.13.19-.29.39-.24.65-.14.27.1 1.69.8 1.98.94.29.15.48.22.55.34.07.13.07.72-.17 1.4Z"/></svg>
        WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="tel:+256742096022">Call</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="bulbs">
      <span class="bulb"></span><span class="bulb"></span><span class="bulb"></span><span class="bulb"></span><span class="bulb"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="eyebrow on-dark">Freelance Web Developer · Uganda</p>
    <h1 style="margin-top:14px;">I build websites that help businesses get <em>more customers.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">I create professional, fast and mobile-friendly websites for businesses that want to build a stronger online presence — and make it easy for customers to reach them.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/256742096022?text=Hello%20Daniel%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20getting%20a%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20my%20requirements." target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.29-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.7 1.2h.01c5.46 0 9.9-4.45 9.9-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.02c-.24.68-1.4 1.32-1.93 1.4-.5.08-1.13.11-1.83-.11-.42-.13-.96-.31-1.66-.6-2.92-1.26-4.83-4.2-4.98-4.4-.15-.19-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.02 0-1.43.75-2.14 1.02-2.43.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.19 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.24.58.82 2.01.9 2.15.07.15.12.32.02.51-.1.19-.15.31-.29.48-.15.17-.31.38-.44.51-.15.15-.3.31-.13.6.17.29.76 1.25 1.63 2.03 1.12 1 2.06 1.31 2.35 1.46.29.15.46.13.63-.08.17-.2.72-.84.92-1.13.19-.29.39-.24.65-.14.27.1 1.69.8 1.98.94.29.15.48.22.55.34.07.13.07.72-.17 1.4Z"/></svg>
        Get Your Website
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="border-color:var(--line-paper); color:var(--paper);" href="#portfolio">
        View My Work
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div><strong>WhatsApp &amp; Call</strong>0742 096022</div>
      <div><strong>Email</strong>daniellambsreigns@gmail.com</div>
      <div><strong>Based in</strong>Uganda</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS ===== -->
<section class="how" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Process</p>
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>A straightforward process from first message to launch — no jargon, no surprises.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card reveal">
        <span class="step-num">01</span>
